    "page.faq.animal-names.p.the-most-frequently-asked-question-is": "The most frequently asked naʼídíłkid is some variation of the following:",
    "page.faq.animal-names.p.i-always-thought-i-was-born": "“I always thought I was born in the Nááhai of the Rabbit, dóó my friend says she was born in the Nááhai of the Rooster, but you have us listed on ní site as the Nááhai of the Cat dóó the Nááhai of the Phoenix. What’s up yił all the changes to the names of the naaldlooshii?”",
