    "page.connType.shadow.p.this-darkly-magnetic-yin-yang-animal": "Díí darkly magnetic Yin-Yang naaldlooshii pairing shows each other's hidden underbellies — revealing what might otherwise stay hidden, whether you like it éí doodago doo! It's a fantastic pairing for karmic work, helping you both to grow through staying committed to the bond dóó discovering what to work on together. I've seen it in plenty of romantic couples, even husbands dóó wives who've been happily married for years, but I've also seen it most easily displayed in student-teacher éí doodago parent-child pairings, where the idea of working out ní faults dóó improving ní tʼáá áníłtso is already baked into the type of relationship.",
