    "page.connType.values-trine.p.shared-value-both-animals-belong-to": "Shared value — both naaldlooshii belong to the same Values Triangle, so you often speak the same saad when it comes to life's priorities.",
    "page.connType.values-trine.p.totem-connections": "<a href=\"connections.html?v=20260807\">← Totem Connections</a>",
    "page.connType.values-trine.p.shared-value-both-animals-belong-to.2": "Shared value — both naaldlooshii belong to the same Values Triangle: Power & Prestige, Security & Stability, Inspiration & Idealism, éí doodago Peace & Harmony. These connections are diné who speak the same saad as you, values-wise. They have similar priorities when it comes to how to go about dealing yił life — whether éí be the pursuit of power dóó craftsmanship in a trade, éí doodago the pursuit of peace dóó an easy-going lifestyle. These are diné you don't have to explain ní tʼáá áníłtso to very often, because they're already on the same page as you, so it can be great for any type of relationship: business éí doodago pleasure, hooghan éí doodago friendship. Cool runnings :)",
