    "home.why-totem-astrology.section-label.our-hope": "Suqʼuyayninchik",
    "home.why-totem-astrology.h2.a-tool-for-understanding-not-an": "Hamutʼaypaq Herramienta — Mana Mana Allin Comportamientopaq Disculpa",
    "home.why-totem-astrology.p.at-the-heart-of-totem-astrology": "At the heart of Totem Astrology is suqʼuyay: suqʼuyay for a clearer hamutʼay of qampa kikiyki, suqʼuyay for better hamutʼay between masikuna hinaspa ayllu runakuna, hinaspa suqʼuyay chay there are runakuna out there who are compatible wan you just the way you are.",
    "home.why-totem-astrology.p.the-four-animal-guides-give-us": "The tawa uywa guía-kuna give us a huklla simi — something abstract ñoqanchik can point to when what is going on inside feels hard to name. When a Monkey is trying to get a Buffalo to climb a tree, ñoqanchik can talk about the clash without everything feeling so personal. The uywakuna symbolize inner modes ñoqanchik all operate manta, hinaspa they unite us in a vocabulary for khuyay.",
    "home.why-totem-astrology.p.this-is-a-tool-for-understanding": "Kay is a herramienta for hamutʼay each other hinaspa offering grace — grace born manta comprehending ñoqanchikpa diferenciakuna hinaspa appreciating the different ways runakuna move through the pacha. It is <em>mana</em> an excuse for mana allin comportamiento, hinaspa it is mana a reason to accept other runakuna’s mana allin comportamiento when harm is being done. Totem Astrology is meant to illuminate, mana to imprison: ñoqanchik learn where ñoqanchik differ so ñoqanchik can show up for ourselves hinaspa for each other wan more patience, mana less accountability.",
    "home.why-totem-astrology.p.take-what-resonates-set-aside-what": "Take what resonates, set aside what doesn’t — hinaspa never use these guía-kuna to justify cruelty, neglect, utaq staying where you are mana safe. Suqʼuyay hinaspa boundaries can live in the same room.",
    "home.how-totem-astrology-works.section-label.the-system": "Sistema",
