    "home.how-totem-astrology-works.p.water-wood-fire-earth-and-metal": "Water, Wood, Fire, Earth, hinaspa Metal — each section of qampa totem pole pairs an uywa wan one of these Five Elements, adding texture to qampa Spirit, Mind, Heart, hinaspa Body guía-kuna.",
    "home.how-totem-astrology-works.btn.read-more.2": "Astawan ñawinchay",
