    "home.how-totem-astrology-works.p.each-totem-animal-carries-fixed-polarity": "Each totem uywa carries fixed polarity manta the start — Squirrel always Yang, Buffalo always Yin, Tiger always Yang, Cat always Yin, hinaspa so on.",
