    "page.connType.shadow.p.this-darkly-magnetic-yin-yang-animal": "Kay darkly magnetic Yin-Yang uywa pairing shows each other's hidden underbellies — revealing what might otherwise stay hidden, whether you like it utaq mana! It's a fantastic pairing for karmic work, helping you both to grow through staying committed to the bond hinaspa discovering what to work on together. I've seen it in plenty of romantic couples, even husbands hinaspa wives who've been happily married for years, but I've also seen it most easily displayed in student-teacher utaq parent-child pairings, where the idea of working out qampa faults hinaspa improving qampa kikiyki is already baked into the type of relationship.",
