    "page.connType.mirror-opposite.p.opposites-on-the-zodiac-wheel-six": "Opposites on the zodiac wheel — six signs apart, facing each other directly across the circle. Ideal for reflecting blindspots hinaspa learning manta a radically different point of view.",
    "page.connType.mirror-opposite.p.totem-connections": "<a href=\"connections.html?v=20260807\">← Totem Connections</a>",
    "page.connType.mirror-opposite.p.opposites-on-the-zodiac-wheel-six.2": "Opposites on the zodiac wheel — six signs apart, facing each other directly across the circle. These connections are perfect for reflecting ourselves hinaspa seeing each other's blindspots — as they are quite literally facing the opposite direction chay you are! Kay can make for some heated arguments, but as long as you bring enough respect to the table, there's a lot to learn here manta qampa mirrors — both of you can see things chay the other cannot, so as long as you trust each other hinaspa act in good faith, kay can be a very helpful hinaspa beautiful connection to have. It will most definitely keep things interesting, as they will no doubt have a different take on things than you, sometimes so radically different chay you didn't even think it was possible!",
