    "page.connType.values-trine.p.shared-value-both-animals-belong-to": "Shared value — both uywakuna belong to the same Values Triangle, so you often speak the same simi when it comes to life's priorities.",
    "page.connType.values-trine.p.totem-connections": "<a href=\"connections.html?v=20260807\">← Totem Connections</a>",
    "page.connType.values-trine.p.shared-value-both-animals-belong-to.2": "Shared value — both uywakuna belong to the same Values Triangle: Power & Prestige, Security & Stability, Inspiration & Idealism, utaq Peace & Harmony. These connections are runakuna who speak the same simi as you, values-wise. They have similar priorities when it comes to how to go about dealing wan life — whether chay be the pursuit of power hinaspa craftsmanship in a trade, utaq the pursuit of peace hinaspa an easy-going lifestyle. These are runakuna you don't have to explain qampa kikiyki to very often, because they're already on the same page as you, so it can be great for any type of relationship: business utaq pleasure, ayllu utaq friendship. Cool runnings :)",
