    "home.why-totem-astrology.h2.a-tool-for-understanding-not-an": "Amuytʼañataki Herramienta — Janiw Jan Walliq Comportamientotaki Disculpa",
    "home.why-totem-astrology.p.at-the-heart-of-totem-astrology": "At the heart of Totem Astrology is suytʼawi: suytʼawi for a clearer amuytʼawi of juma pachpa, suytʼawi for better amuytʼawi between masinaka ukat uta jaqinaka, ukat suytʼawi uka there are jaqinaka out there who are compatible mpi you just the way you are.",
    "home.why-totem-astrology.p.the-four-animal-guides-give-us": "The pusi uywa guía-naka give us a mä aru — something abstract jiwasa can point to when what is going on inside feels hard to name. When a Monkey is trying to get a Buffalo to climb a tree, jiwasa can talk about the clash without everything feeling so personal. The uywanaka symbolize inner modes jiwasa all operate ta, ukat they unite us in a vocabulary for khuyapayaña.",
