    "home.why-totem-astrology.p.take-what-resonates-set-aside-what": "Take what resonates, set aside what doesn’t — ukat never use these guía-naka to justify cruelty, neglect, jan ukaxa staying where you are janiw safe. Suytʼawi ukat boundaries can live in the same room.",
