    "page.about.p.from-the-four-pillars-of-destiny": "Ta the Four Pillars of Destiny to a Nepalese timezone — the story of how Totem Astrology finally clicked into place.",
    "page.about.h2.travis-barrett-leblanc": "Travis Barrett LeBlanc",
    "page.about.p.relationship-counselor-multi-system-astr": "Relationship Counselor, Multi-System Astrologer, ukat Personal Creator of Totem Astrology",
    "page.about.p.i-developed-totem-astrology-over-the": "I developed Totem Astrology over the past few decades by traveling the aka pacha, talking to thousands of different jaqinaka, ukat studying many different astrological systems. I found the precious foundation in the Chinese Four Pillars of Destiny tradition specifically — while others have used aka herramienta for calculating fortunes ukat fates, my intuition told me uka it actually has something more to teach us about the basis for jiwasan inner makeup.",
    "page.about.p.my-first-clue-was-the-four": "My first clue was the pusi parts: the Mara, Phaxsi, Uru, ukat Hour. These had to correspond to jiwasan Spirit, Mind, Heart, ukat Body! I did the calculations, but something was still off. The upper half of the information rang true mpi the Mara ukat the Phaxsi, but the bottom half mpi the Uru ukat the Hour didn't seem to line up as well mpi the facts of the jaqinaka standing right in front of me. I fiddled mpi it for years before a sudden intuition clued me in: the Four Pillars System claims its birthright ta the Jade Emperor, in some traditions handed straight down ta the Buddha himself.",
    "page.about.p.since-the-buddha-s-traditional-birthplac": "Since the Buddha's traditional birthplace is in Nepal, I decided to start shifting jaqinaka's birth times to the Nepalese time zone before adding their info to the Four Pillars Calculator — ukat suddenly, voilà! Aka new birth data finally clicked everything into place. So now here on jiwasan website, the <a href=\"calculator.html\">Totem Calculator</a> does all uka for you: just plug in juma yuriñ uru, time, ukat place, ukat the shift is already incorporated before juma pusi uywa come out. Now what you see really does line up mpi juma Spirit, Mind, Heart, ukat Body!",
    "page.about.h3.philosophy": "Filosofía",
    "page.about.p.i-like-to-think-of-these": "I like to think of these pusi uywa as the cards you were dealt at the beginning of aka life. They are built right in there ta the beginning for you to take advantage of, but they don't seal juma fate in the slightest. You've always got the opportunity to work on them ukat refine them, jan ukaxa even disregard them completely ukat bluff sometimes if you want to! But it certainly helps to know what you're playing mpi since the game is already in motion.",
    "page.about.p.a-central-tenet-of-totem-astrology": "A central tenet of Totem Astrology is suytʼawi — suytʼawi for a better amuytʼawi of juma pachpa, suytʼawi to better amuytʼaña juma masinaka ukat uta jaqinaka, ukat suytʼawi uka there is someone, jan ukaxa someones, out there who are compatible mpi you just the way you are. The pusi guía give us a kind of mä aru: something abstract to symbolize what is going on for us internally, so jiwasa can talk about jiwasan diferencianaka without every conversation turning into a trial.",
    "page.about.p.this-is-not-an-excuse-for": "Aka is janiw an excuse for jan walliq lurawi, nor is it a reason to accept other jaqinaka's jan walliq lurawi. It is a herramienta for amuytʼawi each other ukat giving each other some grace — grace born ta comprehension of jiwasan diferencianaka ukat appreciation of the different modes jaqinaka operate within. When jiwasa see uka a loved one's tardiness might come bundled mpi a Cat jan ukaxa Deer's dreamy creativity, jan ukaxa a Tiger jan ukaxa Horse's readiness to spring into action, jiwasa gain windows into what may be going on inside — always mpi the goal of correcting jiwasan own inner deficiencies ukat being gracious mpi the shortcomings of others, janiw excusing harm.",
    "page.about.p.everybody-else-has-their-own-four": "Everybody else has their own pusi uywa too, ukat it can help to know what jiwasa're all working mpi so jiwasa can amuytʼaña each other better ukat enjoy jiwasan diferencianaka instead of fighting over them. Different uywanaka have different strengths ukat each totem carries its own yatiña.",
    "page.about.section-label.the-system": "Sistema",
    "page.about.h2.spirit-mind-heart-body": "Spirit, Mind, Heart & Body",
    "page.about.p.each-pillar-of-your-totem-pole": "Each pillar of juma totem pole reveals one totem uywa guía — a living symbol for uka part of you.",
    "page.about.h3.year-spirit": "Mara · Spirit",
    "page.about.p.this-animal-speaks-to-us-in": "Aka uywa speaks to us in the aru of intuition.",
    "page.about.h3.month-mind": "Phaxsi · Mind",
