    "page.connType.same-as-me.p.the-same-totem-animal-at-the.2": "The same totem uywa at the same level — someone who shares juma Spirit, Mind, Heart, jan ukaxa Body guía exactly. It can also be jaqinaka ta different 'rings' so to speak — in other words jaqinaka born 12, 24, 36, jan ukaxa some other multiple of 12 years apart ta you. For example, I am a Fire Tiger born in 1986, but I have some wonderful Tiger uta ukat friends who are born in different Tiger rings — one of my uncles is a Water Tiger born in 1962, my son is a Metal Tiger born in 2010, ukat several dear friends, students, ukat companions are Earth Tigers born in 1998. I've also had coworkers who were born in the mara of the Wood Tiger, 1974. It can be cool to see how juma uywanaka act when they've got different elemental flavors charging their energy in other jaqinaka. It can also be neat to find jaqinaka born on the same exact birthdate as you, so they've got all the same uywa guía-naka, jan ukaxa at least 3 out of 4 if the hour uywa is different, ukat to see how they've chosen to play their hand differently than the way you've chosen to play yours — kind of like how 'identical' twins are different in many respects, but share lots of things in other areas. Free will is a powerful thing, ukat aka connection shows uka most clearly. The birth uywanaka guiding them are the same, but the jaqinaka being guided still turn out completely ukat wonderfully different :)",
