    "page.about.p.from-the-four-pillars-of-destiny": "Guive the Four Pillars of Destiny to a Nepalese timezone — the story of how Totem Astrology finally clicked into place.",
    "page.about.h2.travis-barrett-leblanc": "Travis Barrett LeBlanc",
    "page.about.p.relationship-counselor-multi-system-astr": "Relationship Counselor, Multi-System Astrologer, ha Personal Creator of Totem Astrology",
    "page.about.p.i-developed-totem-astrology-over-the": "I developed Totem Astrology over the past few decades by traveling the yvy, talking to thousands of different tapichakuéra, ha studying many different astrological systems. I found the precious foundation in the Chinese Four Pillars of Destiny tradition specifically — while others have used ko tembiporu for calculating fortunes ha fates, my intuition told me upe it actually has something more to teach us about the basis for ore inner makeup.",
    "page.about.p.my-first-clue-was-the-four": "My first clue was the irundy parts: the Ary, Jasy, Ára, ha Hour. These had to correspond to ore Spirit, Mind, Heart, ha Body! I did the calculations, but something was still off. The upper half of the information rang true ndive the Ary ha the Jasy, but the bottom half ndive the Ára ha the Hour didn't seem to line up as well ndive the facts of the tapichakuéra standing right in front of me. I fiddled ndive it for years before a sudden intuition clued me in: the Four Pillars System claims its birthright guive the Jade Emperor, in some traditions handed straight down guive the Buddha himself.",
    "page.about.p.since-the-buddha-s-traditional-birthplac": "Since the Buddha's traditional birthplace is in Nepal, I decided to start shifting tapichakuéra's birth times to the Nepalese time zone before adding their info to the Four Pillars Calculator — ha suddenly, voilà! Ko new birth data finally clicked everything into place. So now here on ore website, the <a href=\"calculator.html\">Totem Calculator</a> does all upe for you: just plug in nde ñemoñehẽ arange, time, ha place, ha the shift is already incorporated before nde irundy mymba come out. Now what you see really does line up ndive nde Spirit, Mind, Heart, ha Body!",
    "page.about.h3.philosophy": "Filosofía",
    "page.about.p.i-like-to-think-of-these": "I like to think of these irundy mymba as the cards you were dealt at the beginning of ko life. They are built right in there guive the beginning for you to take advantage of, but they don't seal nde fate in the slightest. You've always got the opportunity to work on them ha refine them, térã even disregard them completely ha bluff sometimes if you want to! But it certainly helps to know what you're playing ndive since the game is already in motion.",
    "page.about.p.a-central-tenet-of-totem-astrology": "A central tenet of Totem Astrology is ñeʼãrõ — ñeʼãrõ for a better tekotee of nde jehe, ñeʼãrõ to better eikuaa nde irũnguéra ha óga tapicha, ha ñeʼãrõ upe there is someone, térã someones, out there who are compatible ndive you just the way you are. The irundy guía give us a kind of peteĩ ñeʼẽ: something abstract to symbolize what is going on for us internally, so ñande can talk about ore ojoavykuéra without every conversation turning into a trial.",
    "page.about.p.this-is-not-an-excuse-for": "Ko is nda an excuse for vai tekotee, nor is it a reason to accept other tapichakuéra's vai tekotee. It is a tembiporu for tekotee each other ha giving each other some grace — grace born guive comprehension of ore ojoavykuéra ha appreciation of the different modes tapichakuéra operate within. When ñande see upe a loved one's tardiness might come bundled ndive a Cat térã Deer's dreamy creativity, térã a Tiger térã Horse's readiness to spring into action, ñande gain windows into what may be going on inside — always ndive the goal of correcting ore own inner deficiencies ha being gracious ndive the shortcomings of others, nda excusing harm.",
    "page.about.p.everybody-else-has-their-own-four": "Everybody else has their own irundy mymba too, ha it can help to know what ñande're all working ndive so ñande can eikuaa each other better ha enjoy ore ojoavykuéra instead of fighting over them. Different mymbakuéra have different strengths ha each totem carries its own arandu.",
    "page.about.section-label.the-system": "Sistema",
    "page.about.h2.spirit-mind-heart-body": "Spirit, Mind, Heart & Body",
    "page.about.p.each-pillar-of-your-totem-pole": "Each pillar of nde totem pole reveals one totem mymba guía — a living symbol for upe part of you.",
    "page.about.h3.year-spirit": "Ary · Spirit",
