    "page.connType.shadow.p.this-darkly-magnetic-yin-yang-animal": "Aʼin darkly magnetic Yin-Yang xul pairing shows each other's hidden underbellies — revealing what might otherwise stay hidden, whether you like it o ma! It's a fantastic pairing for karmic work, helping you both to grow through staying committed to the bond ut discovering what to work on together. I've seen it in plenty of romantic couples, even husbands ut wives who've been happily married for years, but I've also seen it most easily displayed in student-teacher o parent-child pairings, where the idea of working out aa faults ut improving aat pach is already baked into the type of relationship.",
