    "page.connType.mirror-opposite.p.totem-connections": "<a href=\"connections.html?v=20260807\">← Totem Connections</a>",
    "page.connType.mirror-opposite.p.opposites-on-the-zodiac-wheel-six.2": "Opposites on the zodiac wheel — six signs apart, facing each other directly across the circle. These connections are perfect for reflecting ourselves ut seeing each other's blindspots — as they are quite literally facing the opposite direction li you are! Aʼin can make for some heated arguments, but as long as you bring enough respect to the table, there's a lot to learn here chi ru aa mirrors — both of you can see things li the other cannot, so as long as you trust each other ut act in good faith, aʼin can be a very helpful ut beautiful connection to have. It will most definitely keep things interesting, as they will no doubt have a different take on things than you, sometimes so radically different li you didn't even think it was possible!",
