    "page.connType.values-trine.p.totem-connections": "<a href=\"connections.html?v=20260807\">← Totem Connections</a>",
    "page.connType.values-trine.p.shared-value-both-animals-belong-to.2": "Shared value — both xul belong to the same Values Triangle: Power & Prestige, Security & Stability, Inspiration & Idealism, o Peace & Harmony. These connections are poyanam who speak the same aatin as you, values-wise. They have similar priorities when it comes to how to go about dealing chi life — whether li be the pursuit of power ut craftsmanship in a trade, o the pursuit of peace ut an easy-going lifestyle. These are poyanam you don't have to explain aat pach to very often, because they're already on the same page as you, so it can be great for any type of relationship: business o pleasure, junkabʼaal o friendship. Cool runnings :)",
